{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/619944bbe604abccb3fb43e8a75f2cd0.poster.avif?t=1761551601\" width=798 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/619944bbe604abccb3fb43e8a75f2cd0.webm?t=1761551601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/619944bbe604abccb3fb43e8a75f2cd0.mp4?t=1761551601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear, memory, and motherhood intertwined in a story of loss and resilience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freya, travelling alone and pregnant through rural T\u00fcrkiye, is drawn to an abandoned town lost to time. Searching for a way through, she moves through silence and ruin, unaware that an ancient Mesopotamian terror is waiting beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Belly of the Night is a story-driven survival horror that blends classic design with a modern heartbeat.\u00a0Explore the ruins, uncover hidden paths, and solve puzzles that test both logic and nerve. <br><br>The deeper you go, the darker it will get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/3550a2ffb1ebb2cd85f47bdf1b1d44b6.poster.avif?t=1761551601\" width=798 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/3550a2ffb1ebb2cd85f47bdf1b1d44b6.webm?t=1761551601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/3550a2ffb1ebb2cd85f47bdf1b1d44b6.mp4?t=1761551601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed-camera survival horror inspired by 90s classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A purist cinematic storytelling focusing on an emotional atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management, exploration of secrets and limited but tense combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological and environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eerie and nostalgic original soundtrack and immersive sound design</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102500?t=1761551601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/06350b4da08910df5e04be9c46cd366bb09d1855/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761551601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/a94ea3ce2b7b0bf7f9703142f95da5ada3829881/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761551601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/a94ea3ce2b7b0bf7f9703142f95da5ada3829881/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761551601","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains themes of psychological horror, fear, and emotional distress. It includes mild violence and disturbing imagery related to pregnancy and body horror. There are no depictions of sexual content or explicit gore."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102500/extras/619944bbe604abccb3fb43e8a75f2cd0.poster.avif?t=1761551601\" width=798 height=340 ><source src=\"https://sh